flowchart TD
    RAW[Multi-Satellite Data Streams<br/>CDF · APIs · Catalogs]
    STD[Standardization<br/>units · UTC · resampling]
    QF[Quality Flags & Gaps<br/>outlier · noise · instrument status]
    FUS[Adaptive Fusion<br/>w_i = αR + βQ + γS]
    REC[Missing Data Recovery<br/>cross-sat reconstruction]
    DET[Event Detection<br/>CME · Flare · HSS · SEP]
    PRED[Prediction Engine<br/>arrival · intensity · impact prob]
    UQ[Uncertainty Quantification<br/>PI · reliability · agreement]
    EXP[Explainability<br/>SHAP · physics text · NL summary]
    CONS[AI Consensus<br/>multi-model distributions]
    PHYS{{Physics Validation<br/>PHY-01 … PHY-52}}
    DSS[Decision Support<br/>stakeholder actions]
    UI[Dashboard + API + Audit Logs]

    RAW --> STD --> QF --> FUS --> REC --> DET --> PRED
    PRED --> UQ
    PRED --> EXP
    UQ --> CONS
    EXP --> CONS
    CONS --> PHYS
    PHYS -->|PASS / SOFT_FAIL| DSS
    PHYS -->|HARD_FAIL — advisory only| DSS
    DSS --> UI
    PHYS --> UI

    FUS -.->|fusion_snapshots| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    DET -.->|events| DB
    PRED -.->|predictions| DB
    UQ -.->|uncertainty_estimates| DB
    EXP -.->|explanations| DB
    PHYS -.->|physics_validation_results| DB
    DSS -.->|recommendations · audit_logs| DB
    RAW -.->|time_series_meta| OBJ[(Object Store / TSDB)]

    style PHYS fill:#fde8f0,stroke:#c41e6a,stroke-width:3px
